        "text_cqRANa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Bacton Health, our name reflects our purpose. Inspired by the words <strong>“Back to Normal,”</strong> Bacton represents our commitment to helping women rediscover balance, confidence, and everyday well-being. We understand that menopause brings changes, and we’re here to support your journey toward feeling more like yourself again through thoughtfully selected wellness products.</p><p>Bacton Health Services is your trusted partner in women’s healthcare, dedicated to providing personalized support and the latest treatments for perimenopause and menopause. We understand that midlife transitions can be challenging, which is why we combine evidence-based medical expertise with compassionate care to help you navigate this important life stage with confidence and vitality.</p><p>Our comprehensive approach integrates tailored supplements and prescription therapies specifically designed for your unique needs, alongside our AI-driven Information Resource Center. This innovative platform delivers up-to-date information on current and developing solutions in the menopause area, empowering you to make informed decisions about your health and embrace this chapter of your life with renewed energy and well-being.</p>",
